/*
 * SmartXX CPLD key streams, captured from real chips on the LPC bus.
 *
 * One dword per clock pulse (write of 0 to 0xF7B6), presented at 0xF708-0xF70B,
 * starting from the restart (write of 1 to 0xF7B6). The first 0x746 dwords
 * are the boot handshake; the rest is what the OS clocks for its runtime
 * self-check (49136 dwords, one per 8 bytes of the bootloader and slot-7
 * banks). Extracted with tools/smartxx-keystream.py from DSLogic captures.
 *
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
 */

